; Parallel functions.
; @CGNS_NOPAREXP@ is a CMake configure_file() substitution variable
; (see src/CMakeLists.txt). It expands to ";" when CGNS_ENABLE_PARALLEL
; is OFF (turning each line into a comment) or to "" when it is ON
; (activating the export). This is not a typo — it is intentional.
